        "original_id": "47888c90-458d-5c32-931c-065c7573b08c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nugroho Notosusanto\n- Events: Indonesian National Revolution\n- Organizations: Student Army, Republic of Indonesia, Dutch Empire\n- Topics: Indonesian War of Independence, postwar and postcolonial Indonesia\n\nFacts:\n- The Indonesian National Revolution lasted from 1945 to 1949.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution was also known as the Indonesian War of Independence.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution was an armed conflict and diplomatic struggle between the Republic of Indonesia and the Dutch Empire.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution also involved an internal social revolution in postwar and postcolonial Indonesia.\n- During the Indonesian National Revolution from 1945 to 1949, Nugroho Notosusanto saw active service as a member of the Student Army.\n- During the Indonesian National Revolution, Nugroho Notosusanto worked in reconnaissance for the Student Army.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "4943a528-9903-55bd-8d7f-4b889cf53872",
        "text": "Page: Nugroho Notosusanto. Sentence: During the Indonesian National Revolution from 1945 to 1949 he saw active service as a member of the Student Army, working reconnaissance.\nPage: Indonesian National Revolution. Sentence: The Indonesian National Revolution or Indonesian War of Independence (Indonesian: Perang Kemerdekaan Indonesia , Dutch: \"Indonesische Onafhankelijkheidsoorlog\" ) was an armed conflict and diplomatic struggle between the Republic of Indonesia and the Dutch Empire, and an internal social revolution following the postwar and postcolonial Indonesia.",
